  "description": "Persian text normalization and evasion-resistant profanity filtering for .NET. Folds Arabic/Persian look-alike letters, zero-width and bidi characters, and all three digit ranges, and catches the ways people get around a word list: spaced or dotted letters, held keys, leetspeak, filler symbols, Cyrillic look-alikes and Finglish. Ships an optional curated Persian/Finglish/English word list.",
